        "id": 1361259
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-09-02T01:21:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In addition: if the existing code doesn\u0027t work completely, I think we need to determine why and fix it instead of adding new code that does the same thing differently.",
      "parentUuid": "a7e09485_5b232f57",
      "revId": "e41764d26f7843244bda084395bddf18853adb33",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
